      "id": "Recipe_M20589",
      "type": "Recipe",
      "name": "Crispy Chicken BBQ Snacker",
      "assembly_instructions": "1. Preheat deep-fat fryer to 350 F.   2. Fry frozen chicken patties until golden brown and internal temperature reaches 165 F, 4 to 6 minutes. Drain.  3. Cut each patty into 3 strips.    FOR 1 SERVING: 1. Layer the following in center of 1 tortilla:   2 tsp sauce   1-oz spoodle lettuce   1 piece onion, separated into rings   1 piece chicken   1 slice cheese Fold bottom of tortilla up over filling, about 1\". Fold in right and left edges of tortilla 2\" on each side to form a V. Top 1/3 of filling should be exposed.  2. Keep hot for service.",
