      "type": "Recipe",
      "name": "Creamy Tomato Basil Soup",
      "assembly_instructions": "1. In stockpot over medium-high heat, heat oil. Add onion, celery and carrot. Saute until vegetables are tender, 4 to 6 minutes. Stir in tomato paste and base.  2. Add remaining ingredients except half & half and basil. Whisk until well blended. Bring to a boil. Reduce heat. Simmer 35 minutes. Discard bay leaves. Puree.   3. Heat half & half to 140 F.  4. Return pureed mixture to pot. Stir in heated half & half. Return to a simmer. DO NOT BOIL.  5. Cover. Keep hot for service.  6. At time of service, stir in basil.",
